# @hub-lanes

# ── FLY IDLE MACHINE ALERT (BH-4020) ────────────────────────────────────────
# Daily at 06:37Z: list every machine in FLY_ORG and write ONE logs/ALERTS.log
# line per UTC day naming each machine that is `started`, up more than
# FLY_IDLE_HOURS (default 2), and held by no pool build, dispatcher job or
# queue claim, with its hourly burn. Hub only: the hub holds FLY_API_TOKEN and
# sees every box's queue claims. GET requests only — it never stops, destroys
# or POSTs to a machine. Knobs: FLY_IDLE_HOURS, FLY_IDLE_IGNORE_APPS,
# FLY_IDLE_MAX_APPS, in this lane's catalog/lanes.d/ registry entry.
# Off via the lane's flags/lane-off-<id> flag (bin/harness-ctl.sh off <id>).
37 6 * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/fly-idle-check.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
